---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AuditCTA from '../components/AuditCTA.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Hallmark Studio | Web Design & SEO, Chelmsford Essex"
  description="Hallmark Studio is a web design and SEO agency based in Chelmsford, Essex. Founded by Cormac and Mohamod. We work directly with Essex small businesses."
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">About us</span>
      <h1>We're Cormac and Mohamod. We built this studio to help Essex businesses win online.</h1>
      <p class="page-header__sub">
        Based in Chelmsford. You'll deal with us directly, not an account manager.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FOUNDERS -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">The people behind the work</span>
        <h2>Meet the founders.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="founders-editorial">

        <div class="founder-editorial">
          <div class="founder-editorial__photo">
            <img src="/ourpictures/Screenshot 2026-06-08 130311.png" alt="Cormac, co-founder of Hallmark Studio" width="400" height="533" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="founder-editorial__bio">
            <h4>Cormac</h4>
            <span class="founder-editorial__role">Co-founder, Web Design &amp; SEO Strategy</span>
            <p>
              Cormac's background is in Accounting and Finance, which shapes how he approaches every project. Your online presence is a business problem with a measurable return, not a design exercise. He got tired of watching good Essex businesses lose customers to worse competitors with better websites. Hallmark Studio exists to fix that.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="founder-editorial">
          <div class="founder-editorial__photo">
            <img src="/ourpictures/Screenshot 2026-06-08 130322.png" alt="Mohamod, co-founder of Hallmark Studio" width="400" height="533" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="founder-editorial__bio">
            <h4>Mohamod</h4>
            <span class="founder-editorial__role">Co-founder, Client Relations</span>
            <p>
              Mohamod is the first person you'll hear from and the one you'll deal with throughout the project. He manages every client relationship directly, no handoffs, no middlemen. If you have a question, a concern, or a change of mind at any point, Mohamod is your contact. That's not a promise most agencies can make.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY ESSEX -->
  <section class="section section--grey">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">Why Essex</span>
        <h2>We're local because it matters.</h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        We're based in Chelmsford and we work with businesses across Essex, Colchester, Southend, Brentwood, Basildon, and beyond.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
        Being local isn't just a selling point. It means we understand the market. We know what a Chelmsford plumber's customers are searching for. We know what "the high street" means in Colchester versus Southend. That context shows up in the work.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
        It also means you can pick up the phone and talk to someone who's heard of the businesses you're competing with.
      </p>

      <p class="location-line">
        Working across <strong>Chelmsford, Colchester, Southend-on-Sea, Brentwood, Basildon, Witham, Braintree, Harlow</strong> and the wider Essex area.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NEW AGENCY ADVANTAGE -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">Honest about where we are</span>
        <h2>We're new. Here's why that's an advantage for you.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="new-agency">
        <p>
          <strong>We don't have 50 reviews on Google yet.</strong> We won't pretend otherwise. But here's what that means in practice:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-top:1.25rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.875rem; padding-left:1.5rem; list-style:disc;">
          <li style="color:var(--text); font-size:.9375rem; line-height:1.65;">
            <strong>You get the founders on your project.</strong> Not a junior designer who joined last month. Cormac and Mohamod, directly.
          </li>
          <li style="color:var(--text); font-size:.9375rem; line-height:1.65;">
            <strong>Fast replies.</strong> We're not managing 50 clients. When you email us, we respond the same day.
          </li>
          <li style="color:var(--text); font-size:.9375rem; line-height:1.65;">
            <strong>Our prices will go up.</strong> Once the reviews come in and the case studies build up, we'll charge more. Early clients get the current rates locked in for the duration of their plan.
          </li>
          <li style="color:var(--text); font-size:.9375rem; line-height:1.65;">
            <strong>We need to earn it.</strong> We're hungrier than an established agency that can afford to coast. Every project matters.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT DRIVES US -->
  <section class="section section--grey">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">Why we started</span>
        <h2>The thing we kept seeing.</h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        Before starting Hallmark Studio, we kept seeing the same pattern. A great local business, a brilliant plumber, a packed-out salon, a restaurant with a five-star reputation, losing enquiries online to a worse competitor with a better website.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
        Not because the competitor was better at the job. Just because their site loaded faster, showed up on Google, and made it easy to call.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
        That's a solvable problem. We started Hallmark Studio to solve it, for Essex businesses specifically.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <AuditCTA
    heading="See what we'd do with your business online."
    sub="Free 15-minute audit. We'll look at your website and Google listing and tell you exactly what we'd fix first."
  />

</Layout>
